{"meta":{"count":55,"notes":["Every record is attested independently by both cited sources: the geometry supplies the old-to-new edge, the code list supplies the date. The build fails if they disagree.","kind is \"merger\" when the old municipality ceased to exist, and \"recode\" when it survived unchanged under a new number. The distinction matters: a recode can be followed silently, whereas a merger means the old boundary no longer exists and any per-municipality figure crossing it is an aggregate.","The 2019 wave has both kinds. Seven mergers retired 15 codes and created 7 (589 to 581 municipalities). The other 11 records are recodes from the Hainaut administrative-district reform. They still must pass through this table, or a pre-2019 statistic for La Louvière will silently fail to join.","The 2025 wave retired 29 codes and created 13; Antwerpen absorbed Borsbeek while keeping NIS 11002, so 30 municipalities were affected and the count fell from 581 to 565.","Bastogne and Bertogne merged on 1 December 2024, a month before the Flemish wave. Their valid_from reflects that.","Coverage is the 2019 and 2025 waves only. The 1977 amalgamation is out of scope: BeHERE ships no data older than 2019."],"vintage":"2025-01-01"},"records":[{"kind":"merger","new_nis":"11002","old_fr":"Borsbeek","old_nis":"11007","old_nl":"Borsbeek","src":["statbel_refnis_2025","statbel_sectors_2025"],"valid_from":"2025-01-01"},{"kind":"merger","new_nis":"46030","old_fr":"Zwijndrecht","old_nis":"11056","old_nl":"Zwijndrecht","src":["statbel_refnis_2025","statbel_sectors_2025"],"valid_from":"2025-01-01"},{"kind":"merger","new_nis":"12041","old_fr":"Puurs","old_nis":"12030","old_nl":"Puurs","src":["statbel_refnis_2025","statbel_sectors_2025"],"valid_from":"2019-01-01"},{"kind":"merger","new_nis":"12041","old_fr":"Sint-Amands","old_nis":"12034","old_nl":"Sint-Amands","src":["statbel_refnis_2025","statbel_sectors_2025"],"valid_from":"2019-01-01"},{"kind":"merger","new_nis":"23106","old_fr":"Gammera